# QUIRK/DEFECT: a plane whose address is not 16-byte aligned makes the reference print a diagnostic with the pointer to stdout (suppressed by the runner) and report peak 1.0 for that channel; magnitude is computed normally.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
source a input
meter_new 0 0
meter_attach 0 a
meter_cb 0 add
meter_misaligned 0 a
